# Copy to .env. EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are compiled into the app: nothing secret goes here.
# mock: no backend; an empty Clerk key gives the demo sign-in. live: needs the API URL and a Clerk key.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_MODE=mock
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# 1: a development or evaluation build, with the LiDAR tools in Settings and Documents in the Files app. It is 1
# here because this file is the development setup; leave it empty for a build that goes to users.
# app.config.ts reads it at prebuild. Turning it on needs a prebuild; turning it off needs `npx expo prebuild --clean`,
# because Expo's Info.plist step merges keys and can't remove the Files app's.
EXPO_PUBLIC_DEV_TOOLS=1
